setUpClass error. The historical verifier source bound rejects 11,172 actual
bytes against its original 9,233-byte contract. Related source, guards and
workflow blobs are unchanged from e798, and the current-source observer
explicitly retains that refusal. Later scope reporting is skipped.

The additional prospective runtime job 128954796921 is also a real FAIL,
with Cargo exit 101. Its all-feature debug Node library target records
1,340 passed / 39 ignored; the later NPQ6 local CLI integration target records
3 passed / 1 failed / 1 ignored. For owner_profile=null, the child has already
