reached. Eight related complete test/fixture/parser/entry/manifest/lock/driver
blobs are identical at e798 and 117. The precise diagnostic cause remains
unknown; this is not a blanket exclusion of indirect effects or a workspace
pass. Four source observations agree on b472 / tree 1625528. See the
[runtime failure readback](runtime-shard-summary.json) and its complete original
ZIPs and job log.

The final retained snapshot at 2026-11-09 03:56:55 UTC records required-baseline
with 19 jobs: nine success, seven failure and three runtime/quality shards
still in progress. The six-job analysis above covers its original six failures;
the seventh is prospective runtime shard 128954796921. Priority acceptance
42553752003 and PQ network/rollback 42553752095 are also in progress.
The [complete retained snapshot](latest-hosted-ci-snapshot.json) preserves the
